    "parts", "sections", "components", "stages", "steps", ... (medium);
  - verbs and words that introduce a list: "consists", "comprises", "composed",
    "following", "follows", and "into" after "divided"/"split"/"classified";
  - "of" right after "types", "kinds", "consists", ...;
